  "ai_overview": {
    "text_blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Stay off the roof and check for damage safely from the ground."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Immediate Safety & Assessment"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Stay off the roof: Wet or broken structures are unsafe and slippery."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Check the ground: Walk around the outside to look for missing shingles, dented gutters, and fallen branches."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Inspect the interior: Look at ceilings and walls for water stains or leaks."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Watch a brief guide on how to inspect your property from the ground after a storm:"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Document and Protect"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Take photos: Photograph all visible damage outside and inside before making any changes."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Prevent more damage: Place buckets under active leaks and use a tarp to cover exposed areas if safe."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Call a professional: Contact a local Severe Storm Roof Damage Guide expert for a thorough inspection.",
            "snippet_links": [
              {
                "text": "Severe Storm Roof Damage Guide",
                "link": "https://ridgeline-roofing.com/news/what-to-do-after-your-roof-is-hit-by-a-severe-storm/"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Learn why you should act fast on temporary repairs rather than rushing into a full contract:"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Insurance and Repairs"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Call your insurer: Report the damage to your insurance company to start a claim."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Schedule repairs: Work with your contractor and insurance adjuster to plan permanent repairs."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you'd like, tell me:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "What type of weather caused the damage (hail, high wind, heavy snow)?"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Are you currently experiencing any active water leaks inside your home?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "I can provide more tailored guidance for your next steps."
      },
